title: Pterobacter
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
authors:
  - given-names: Michael
    name-particle: B
    family-names: Hall
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3683-6208'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/mbhall88/pterobacter'
abstract: >-
  Pterobacter classifies Enterobacter isolate assemblies in a single
  self-contained executable. It reports a species and subspecies call
  only when the approved rules support one, and shows the nearest-reference
  evidence either way.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - Enterobacter
  - classification
  - average nucleotide identity
